# Grid Table Review Checklist

Review priorities:
- Behavioral regressions in sorting/filtering/pagination/selection/expansion/drag-drop.
- Performance regressions in render loops and derived state.
- Accessibility regressions in keyboard/focus/aria behavior.
- Type-safety and alias-import consistency.

Required checks:
- `Name.tsx`, `Name.types.ts`, `Name.const.ts`, `index.ts` structure preserved.
- No stale `types.ts`/`constants.ts` alongside `Name.*` files.
- No magic literals where shared constants are available.
- `clsx` used for conditional classes.
- JSX conditional branches extracted when blocks become complex.
- Unused params/locals removed.

Build gates:
- `npm run typecheck`
- `npm run build`
- Validate portal against local library before release.
